<Document>
  <name>Salishan 躺平之旅 9/4-9/7 · 全部点位</name>
  <description><![CDATA[Salishan 躺平之旅 9/4-9/7 — 所有游玩点+餐厅+观鲸 backup，含备注与 Google Maps 链接。导入 Google My Maps 后可逐点打开。]]></description>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bellevue 出发</name>
    <description><![CDATA[出发起点 Bellevue,WA。内陆线 I-5→Salem→OR-18→Salishan，约287mi/4.5-5h（含停靠）。Model Y 建议中点 Keizer 补电。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Bellevue,+WA/@47.5978965,-122.1510501,12z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54906bcfa3a66041:0xbacf5482ead00765!8m2!3d47.6101497!4d-122.2015159!16zL20vMDEwcjZm?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-122.1510501,47.5978965,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Keizer Station 充电+午餐（中点）</name>
    <description><![CDATA[中途充电+午餐点：I-5 exit 260 Keizer Station。16桩 Tesla V4(325kW) 补电20-25min到75-80%；Red Robin 儿童菜单。补满后 OR-18 到 Salishan 约85mi，到店55-60%。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Keizer+Station/@45.0097464,-122.9983945,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x5495575621d16799:0xa297f3d7e9c78b1c!8m2!3d45.0097464!4d-122.9983945!16s%2Fg%2F11fll5ns2_?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-122.9983945,45.0097464,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Salishan Coastal Lodge 抵达+泡泳池</name>
    <description><![CDATA[基地 Salishan Coastal Lodge(Gleneden Beach,SCP)。室内泳池24/7、热水缸7-10pm、Aerial Park(8岁+60磅)。门口8桩Tesla目的地L2过夜满电。晚餐：The Attic(4-9pm)或房内送餐。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Salishan+Coastal+Lodge+by+SCP+Hotels/@44.8884692,-124.0229703,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!3m8!1s0x54c1dcb2c9a76aad:0xcce73cf2a5abd62c!5m2!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d44.8884692!4d-124.0229703!16s%2Fm%2F04yk65p?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-124.0229703,44.8884692,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Cascade Head 生物圈导览</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Cascade Head 生物圈导览(Knight Park,Otis)。免费90min自然科普；需防水鞋、无狗、湿滑段。娃没兴致可skip。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Knight+Park/@45.0408702,-123.9911607,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54eaecef9b1c2521:0x31348ce8d4173b9b!8m2!3d45.0408702!4d-123.9911607!16s%2Fg%2F1tdr30v2?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
