      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-123.9911607,45.0408702,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Lincoln City · 玻璃浮标寻宝</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lincoln City 玻璃浮标寻宝(D River)。全年藏3000+颗免费，找到归你。白天投放、高潮线上方；1户/年限1颗。结构化寻宝对敏感娃友好。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/D+River+State+Recreation+Site/@44.9674498,-124.0176911,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54ea8d73a103a223:0x1c5d15cda852ae0d!8m2!3d44.9674498!4d-124.0176911!16s%2Fm%2F04q7gld?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-124.0176911,44.9674498,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Roads End 沙滩</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Roads End 沙滩(Lincoln City北端)。平坦开阔、礁石峡谷+海石柱，傍晚人少适合娃玩沙追浪。带小桶铲子+防晒。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Roads+End+State+Recreation+Site/@45.0082978,-124.0091672,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54eaed4babb6c747:0x710ec9aabf6d7202!8m2!3d45.0082978!4d-124.0091672!16s%2Fm%2F04q0shs?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-124.0091672,45.0082978,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Boiler Bay 观景台</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Boiler Bay 观景台(免费)。玄武岩礁崖+浪，全俄州最佳灰鲸观景点(9月旺季每天5-15头)。停车即看无队无楼。⚠️观鲸中心8/1-10/31整修关闭。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Boiler+Bay+State+Scenic+Viewpoint/@44.8301548,-124.0655195,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54ea880e0967fe31:0xf8be0bb20e8f5284!8m2!3d44.8301548!4d-124.0655195!16s%2Fm%2F04qbmm2?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-124.0655195,44.8301548,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Devils Punchbowl 大砂锅</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Devils Punchbowl 天然礁石碗(免费)。护栏俯瞰巨浪漩涡，震撼。海浪声大，怕响的娃站远/戴耳罩。下午人多，上午去。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Devils+Punchbowl+State+Natural+Area/@44.7468595,-124.0635012,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54ea7c31f626a85f:0xb3a9abdcacb5fa14!8m2!3d44.7468595!4d-124.0635012!16s%2Fm%2F047c06l?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-124.0635012,44.7468595,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Yaquina Head 灯塔+潮池</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Yaquina Head 灯塔($7/车)。安静解说中心+平缓步道到灯塔+低潮潮池(海星/海胆/海葵)。塔内整修只开放一段。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Yaquina+Head+Outstanding+Natural+Area/@44.6762003,-124.0772211,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54ea78eecad2748d:0xeaed977c5971020c!8m2!3d44.6762003!4d-124.0772211!16s%2Fg%2F11b77hs3gm?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-124.0772211,44.6762003,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Hatfield 海洋科学中心</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hatfield 海洋科学中心(OSU,全家≈$15)。室内潮池触摸缸+蓝鲸骨架+船模拟器，最低感官最平静，Seattle没有。⚠️章鱼喂食暂停。雨天备份。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hatfield+Marine+Science+Center+Oregon+State+University/@44.6227578,-124.04525,17z/data=!4m10!1m2!2m1!1sHatfield+Marine+Science+Center+Newport+OR!3m6!1s0x54c1d7aecf50511b:0x4e2e1128b3075cf6!8m2!3d44.6226895!4d-124.0454078!15sCilIYXRmaWVsZCBNYXJpbmUgU2NpZW5jZSBDZW50ZXIgTmV3cG9ydCBPUlorIiloYXRmaWVsZCBtYXJpbmUgc2NpZW5jZSBjZW50ZXIgbmV3cG9ydCBvcpIBCmxhYm9yYXRvcnngAQA!16s%2Fm%2F043jtfx?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
    <Style>
      <IconStyle><color>ff16a34a</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-124.04525,44.6227578,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Lincoln City Glass Center</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Lincoln City Glass Center(免费看吹玻璃)。小而安静工作室，低噪可控；自己吹$75-225。周一开、回程顺路。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Lincoln+City+Glass+Center/@44.9289462,-124.0170966,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54ea8c3202057517:0x7ee0b7e783250bc1!8m2!3d44.9289462!4d-124.0170966!16s%2Fg%2F1tlbj8yf?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
