    </Style>
    <ExtendedData>
      <Data name="type"><value>stop</value></Data>
    </ExtendedData>
    <Point><coordinates>-124.0170966,44.9289462,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>返回 Bellevue</name>
    <description><![CDATA[逛完玻璃中心，取道 US-101 北上 Lincoln City，转 HWY-18 东向内陆，接 I-5 北上，I-205 绕过波特兰中心回 Bellevue，傍晚到家。
🗺 https://www.google.com/maps/place/Bellevue,+WA/@47.5978965,-122.1510501,12z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x54906bcfa3a66041:0xbacf5482ead00765!8m2!3d47.6101497!4d-122.2015159!16zL20vMDEwcjZm?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D]]></description>
